tional layer only, never used directly as the environment"}, {"id": "rect_67", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 817, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_74", "seed": 1803817088, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200995868, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_68", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_68", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 825, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_74", "seed": 2028687212, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 579690177, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "PettingZoo ParallelEnv\nMulti-agent contract: all satellites act simultaneously each step (Parallel API \u2014 not the turn-based AEC API)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_67", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "PettingZoo ParallelEnv\nMulti-agent contract: all satellites act simultaneously each step (Parallel API \u2014 not the turn-based AEC API)"}, {"id": "arrow_69", "type": "arrow", "x": 788.0, "y": 792, "width": 1, "height": 25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_74", "seed": 1018118421, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1496886435, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0.0, 0], [0.0, 25]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "rect_70", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 902, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_74", "seed": 1426256014, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 139586394, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_71", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_71", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 910, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_74", "seed": 130286598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1570152712, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "RLlib\nMAPPO/CTDE training, rollout, and policy/critic infrastructure \u2014 consumes the ParallelEnv", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_70", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "RLlib\nMAPPO/CTDE training, rollout, and policy/critic infrastructure \u2014 consumes the ParallelEnv"}, {"id": "arrow_72", "type": "arrow", "x": 788.0, "y": 877, "width": 1, "height": 25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_74", "seed": 1506442652, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 664876774, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "points": [[0.0, 0], [0.0, 25]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "text_73", "type": "text", "x": 568, "y": 987, "width": 440, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_74", "seed": 1389698625, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1241130074, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "rl/environment.py subclasses ParallelEnv directly (Gymnasium spaces for typing) \u2014 avoid wrapper-on-wrapper layering. Verify RLlib's current PettingZoo integration pattern at implementation time (Phase 3) \u2014 this API has changed across Ray versions.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "rl/environment.py subclasses ParallelEnv directly (Gymnasium spaces for typing) \u2014 avoid wrapper-on-wrapper layering. Verify RLlib's current PettingZoo integration pattern at implementation time (Phase 3) \u2014 this API has changed across Ray versions."}, {"id": "frame_74", "type": "frame", "x": 540, "y": 692, "width": 496, "height": 343, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 2132657286, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1462945690, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "name": "3 \u2014 RL Environment Stack (Gymnasium \u2192 PettingZoo \u2192 RLlib)"}, {"id": "text_75", "type": "text", "x": 568, "y": 1105, "width": 440, "height": 25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 1765070035, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 957006265, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "R_i = w1\u00b7R_safety + w2\u00b7R_mission \u2212 w3\u00b7||\u0394v|| \u2212 w4\u00b7C_coordination", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "R_i = w1\u00b7R_safety + w2\u00b7R_mission \u2212 w3\u00b7||\u0394v|| \u2212 w4\u00b7C_coordination"}, {"id": "rect_76", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 1160, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 611164248, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1538946474, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_77", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_77", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 1168, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 828480808, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1904904517, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "R_safety  (w1 = 1.0)\nMargin-based: m = (d_min \u2212 d_safe) / d_safe", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_76", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "R_safety  (w1 = 1.0)\nMargin-based: m = (d_min \u2212 d_safe) / d_safe"}, {"id": "rect_78", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 1240, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 1435920784, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 745188127, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_79", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_79", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 1248, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 48453508, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2020027419, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "R_mission  (w2 = 0.3)\nNormalized orbital-element deviation, not raw position", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_78", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "R_mission  (w2 = 0.3)\nNormalized orbital-element deviation, not raw position"}, {"id": "rect_80", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 1320, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 991483082, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 763353365, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_81", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_81", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 1328, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 360881140, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1311939741, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "\u0394v cost  (w3 = 0.1)\nProportional to applied burn magnitude", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_80", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "\u0394v cost  (w3 = 0.1)\nProportional to applied burn magnitude"}, {"id": "rect_82", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 1400, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 251461309, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1060197638, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_83", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_83", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 1408, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 126603649, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 468597630, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "C_coordination  (w4 = 0.5)\n\u0394(total constellation risk) \u2014 did I make it worse globally?", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_82", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "C_coordination  (w4 = 0.5)\n\u0394(total constellation risk) \u2014 did I make it worse globally?"}, {"id": "rect_84", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 1480, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 1649767777, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 617255373, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_85", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_85", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 1488, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_86", "seed": 277756008, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1585623284, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "Collision penalty\nLarge fixed terminal penalty: \u2212100", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_84", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "Collision penalty\nLarge fixed terminal penalty: \u2212100"}, {"id": "frame_86", "type": "frame", "x": 540, "y": 1065, "width": 496, "height": 503, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 531748802, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 854478761, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "name": "4 \u2014 Reward Function"}, {"id": "rect_87", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 1638, "width": 440, "height": 102, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_91", "seed": 839558095, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1968847850, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_88", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_88", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 1646, "width": 424, "height": 86, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_91", "seed": 1871364441, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1066240031, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "Risk proxy\nz = d_min / (\u03c3_rel + \u03b5)\nR = 1 / (1 + exp(\u2212k\u00b7(z0 \u2212 z)))\n\u03b5=1.0m, z0=3.0, k=1.5", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_87", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "Risk proxy\nz = d_min / (\u03c3_rel + \u03b5)\nR = 1 / (1 + exp(\u2212k\u00b7(z0 \u2212 z)))\n\u03b5=1.0m, z0=3.0, k=1.5"}, {"id": "rect_89", "type": "rectangle", "x": 568, "y": 1765, "width": 440, "height": 102, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_91", "seed": 173047028, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 357268878, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_90", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_90", "type": "text", "x": 576, "y": 1773, "width": 424, "height": 86, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_91", "seed": 964622594, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 862524476, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "text": "Adaptive safety margin\nd_safe = clip(d_base\u00b7(1+\u03b1\u00b7\u03a3norm+\u03b2\u00b7\u03c1+\u03b3\u00b7R), d_min, d_max)\nd_base=1000m, d_min=200m, d_max=5000m\n\u03b1=1.0, \u03b2=0.5, \u03b3=1.0", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "rect_89", "lineHeight": 1.3, "originalText": "Adaptive safety margin\nd_safe = clip(d_base\u00b7(1+\u03b1\u00b7\u03a3norm+\u03b2\u00b7\u03c1+\u03b3\u00b7R), d_min, d_max)\nd_base=1000m, d_min=200m, d_max=5000m\n\u03b1=1.0, \u03b2=0.5, \u03b3=1.0"}, {"id": "frame_91", "type": "frame", "x": 540, "y": 1598, "width": 496, "height": 297, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 1179913225, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 596654992, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": null, "name": "5 \u2014 Risk & Adaptive Margin Formulas"}, {"id": "rect_92", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1136, "y": 160, "width": 440, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_112", "seed": 1897052333, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 294046656, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "text_93", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1710000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "text_93", "type": "text", "x": 1144, "y": 168, "width": 424, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame_112", "seed": 1759390061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 92453820